'''Solgaleo ex''' (Japanese: '''ソルガレオex''' ''Solgaleo ex'') is a {{ct|Metal}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

